ecause the task supplies the relevant identity, document ownership, and object-permission premises; deployment behavior and repository-wide completeness remain untested.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"ShareLinkViewSet is the declared create entry and uses IsAuthenticated and PaperlessObjectPermissions; its model is ShareLink.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-31c7d9610aa471a1","startLine":4696,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"f-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The view's serializer construction passes the authenticated request user as the serializer user for permission-aware serializers.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-31c7d9610aa471a1","startLine":411,"endLine":418}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The referenced document is the object supplied to document validation, and the validation performs an owner-aware view_document check on that document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2873,"endLine":2881}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"Document acceptance requires the global documents.view_document permission and the owner-aware has_perms_owner_aware view_document check; the owner-aware helper permits an owner or an object permission, not merely the global grant.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2874,"endLine":2882},{"sourceId":"src-f24e5731eac21501","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Only after validation does the serializer create the new share-link object; failed document validation raises PermissionDenied instead.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2869,"endLine":2871},{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2882,"endLine":2886}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The document-validation authorization condition is conjunctive: the caller must have the global view_document permission and pass the owner-aware object check for the referenced document.